Two horizontal equal-height physical Cartesian rectangles in an oblique finite P1 cell.
Written 2026-09-10. Existing NumPy 2.5.1/JAX 0.11.0 on Apple M4, 16 GiB; no new dependency or external source addition.
Separate immutable positive-gap/contact charts; no public adapter widening, opening-gap derivative, generic geometry or optical qualification.
Preliminary raw arrays are not distributed. Integrated tests recompute independent original nodal/Duffy references from source.
The original optional contact q16/q24 failure is retained. Only reference quadrature increased to q24/q32 on the same finite space; no tolerance changed.
Sampled RSS and child resource high-water marks are retained as distinct measurements.
